      release. Cite this one.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.14538105"
    description: >-
      Companion data deposit (concept DOI, all versions): Supplementary Data for
      "Sugar-rich foods exacerbate antibiotic-induced microbiome disruption"
